{%- comment -%}
  The DECLARED governing process of one directory, drawn.

  Owner, 2026-09-29: *"show highlevel (sub)process bpmn on the uploads page."*

  Included by subgraph.liquid, and only when the directory declares
  `coverage.process`. Reads `process`, resolved by
  `scripts/governing-process.ts`:

    name          the declared diagram basename, echoed whatever else resolved
    title         `<bpmn:process name>`, "" when the diagram was not found
    bpmn, svg     links relative to THIS directory, "" when not resolved
    startEvents   the names of the diagram's start events, read from the
                  element type rather than from any label
    subprocesses  each call activity: id, name, skill, calls, bpmn, svg
    undetermined  why the drawing is missing, "" when it is not

  A directory declaring nothing never reaches this file. A declaration that
  resolves to nothing prints `could not determine` and keeps the section: a
  printed absence and a real absence must not look alike.
{%- endcomment -%}
## Governing process{% if process.title != "" %} — {{ process.title }}{% endif %}

