{%- if process.startEvents.size > 0 -%}
It begins at {% if process.startEvents.size == 1 %}the start **event** “{{ process.startEvents[0] }}”{% else %}{{ process.startEvents.size }} start **events** — {% for e in process.startEvents %}“{{ e }}”{% unless forloop.last %}, {% endunless %}{% endfor %}{% endif %}. An event is something that has already happened, so whatever brings the process to that point is **outside** this diagram.

{% endif -%}
